{"id":843379,"title":"08｜实战演示","content":"本文介绍了定制数字人的实战步骤，重点在于拍摄和声音录制。首先，从人设角度出发，明确数字人的商业定位，如专家、总裁或知识博主等。其次，形象拍摄需自然放松，保持安静环境，控制时长在3-6分钟内，避免指向性动作和脸部遮挡。驱动视频尤其重要，决定了数字人的最终动作和姿态。训练时长约为10小时。声音录制要求安静无混响环境，推荐使用有线设备，避免蓝牙耳机，确保情绪符合人设。声音训练时间较短，约10分钟。通过手机APP“数字员工”进行素材上传，选择高级定制，注意语言类型匹配。背景可保留实景或抠绿幕，但需与服装颜色区分明显。提交后系统检测视频质量，训练完成后配置名称和声音。整个过程简单易操作，适用于网页端和手机端制作视频。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":397480,"user_name":"Geek_241ca4","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3616701,"ip_address":"美国","ucode":"523679A0372A63","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1738725198,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144234,"content":"开通测试账号联系我微信：sdzhx414","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":4073753,"ctime":1738809264,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":397480,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100856601,"comment_content":"数字员工app下架了，没法下载","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":4073753,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/3e/29/19/791d0f5e.jpg","nickname":"张宏祥","note":"","ucode":"66EC38BF261952","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":656788,"discussion_content":"开通测试账号联系我微信：sdzhx414","content_length":20,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1738809264,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":397416,"user_name":"InfoQ_6792a017d8d3","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1604463,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"3F172927239F99","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eqjZHY70Lke3YzZFibuibLTmt0NfXqj3zVBIGrauOzZj19B3RMo4iaY9ibXq3ar9lSGPdgcqzw2UrgMjQ/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":17